            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/ccd.26642</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A scoring or cutting balloon is always useful in preventing slippage during therapy of in-stent restenosis. A drug-coated scoring balloon for in-stent restenosis may be an alternative to a drug-coated balloon Definitive comparison trials are needed and likely to help define their exact role in patients with in-stent restenosis.</AbstractText>
